{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddcc Goblin Adventure: Free from Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short RPG where a goblin just wants to go home.</strong><br>No side quests. No map. Lore is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mushrooms, argue with a mage, and maybe fall in love.<br>You don\u2019t have to understand what\u2019s happening.<br>But you can.<br>Or you can just open the portal and leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude84 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurdist fantasy RPG (~10\u201315 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical dialogues (but, like\u2026 chill)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss who quotes theory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goblin who doesn\u2019t care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-irony, love, and a trans gnome</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae For players who:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are tired of 100-hour RPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just want a bit of mushroom-based meaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aren\u2019t afraid to answer \u201cProbably yes\u201d to philosophical threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac You don\u2019t have to get it.<br>You\u2019re just a goblin.<br>And that\u2019s enough.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775190?t=1755850657","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775190/d5f9190237f8e72c69a77bd0f58d5f7584ea96ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755850657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775190/9f4894af9aaefb97f77a44eae5bdb8d4f946adf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755850657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775190/9f4894af9aaefb97f77a44eae5bdb8d4f946adf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755850657","categories":[{"